{"seq":1,"slug":"audio-preprocessing","title":"音频预处理与增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/production-audio-systems/audio-preprocessing","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频预处理与增强\">音频预处理与增强</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>音频预处理（Audio Preprocessing）和语音增强（Speech Enhancement）是所有语音和音频 AI 系统的第一道关卡。真实环境中的音频通常包含背景噪声、混响、信道失真和多说话人干扰，如果不进行有效的前处理，后续的 ASR、TTS、说话人识别等系统的性能会大幅下降。预处理的目标是从含噪信号中恢复干净的目标语音，同时尽量保留语音的自然度和可懂度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[含噪音频] --&gt; B[采样率转换&lt;br&gt;重采样]&#10;    B --&gt; C[语音活动检测&lt;br&gt;VAD]&#10;    C --&gt; D[降噪增强&lt;br&gt;Denoising]&#10;    D --&gt; E[去混响&lt;br&gt;Dereverberation]&#10;    E --&gt; F[增益归一化&lt;br&gt;Loudness Norm]&#10;    F --&gt; G[干净音频]\">graph LR\n    A[含噪音频] --&gt; B[采样率转换&lt;br&gt;重采样]\n    B --&gt; C[语音活动检测&lt;br&gt;VAD]\n    C --&gt; D[降噪增强&lt;br&gt;Denoising]\n    D --&gt; E[去混响&lt;br&gt;Dereverberation]\n    E --&gt; F[增益归一化&lt;br&gt;Loudness Norm]\n    F --&gt; G[干净音频]</pre><p>音频预处理面临的主要退化类型及其影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退化类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>对 ASR 的影响</th>\n<th>对 TTS 的影响</th>\n<th>处理难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加性噪声</td>\n<td>环境声、设备噪声</td>\n<td>WER↑ 10-50%</td>\n<td>训练数据质量差</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混响</td>\n<td>房间反射</td>\n<td>WER↑ 5-20%</td>\n<td>录音发闷</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信道失真</td>\n<td>麦克风、编码</td>\n<td>频谱偏移</td>\n<td>音质下降</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>削波失真</td>\n<td>录音电平过高</td>\n<td>信息丢失</td>\n<td>不可恢复</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多说话人</td>\n<td>串音、远场</td>\n<td>识别混乱</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"传统信号处理方法\">传统信号处理方法</h2><p>传统方法基于统计信号处理理论，不需要训练数据，计算开销小，适合嵌入式和实时场景。</p>\n<p><strong>谱减法（Spectral Subtraction）</strong> 是最经典的降噪方法。假设噪声是平稳的，在无语音帧（由 VAD 检测）估计噪声功率谱，然后从含噪信号的功率谱中减去噪声估计，保留语音成分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;import librosa&#10;&#10;def spectral_subtraction(noisy: np.ndarray, sr: int, n_fft: int = 512):&#10;    stft = librosa.stft(noisy, n_fft=n_fft)&#10;    magnitude = np.abs(stft)&#10;    phase = np.angle(stft)&#10;&#10;    noise_frames = magnitude[:, :10]&#10;    noise_estimate = np.mean(noise_frames, axis=1, keepdims=True)&#10;&#10;    clean_magnitude = np.maximum(magnitude - noise_estimate * 1.5, 0.01 * magnitude)&#10;&#10;    clean_stft = clean_magnitude * np.exp(1j * phase)&#10;    clean_signal = librosa.istft(clean_stft)&#10;    return clean_signal\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spectral_subtraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(noisy: np.ndarray, sr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_fft: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.stft(noisy, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_fft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    magnitude </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.abs(stft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.angle(stft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise_frames </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> magnitude[:, :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    noise_estimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(noise_frames, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdims</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clean_magnitude </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.maximum(magnitude </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise_estimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> magnitude)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clean_stft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clean_magnitude </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clean_signal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.istft(clean_stft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clean_signal</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>维纳滤波（Wiener Filter）</strong> 从最小均方误差（MMSE）的角度设计最优滤波器。它估计信噪比（SNR），在高 SNR 帧保留更多信号，在低 SNR 帧更激进地压制噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>波束成形（Beamforming）</strong> 利用多麦克风阵列的空间信息，通过延时-求和或 MVDR（最小方差无畸变响应）等算法增强目标方向的信号。智能音箱（Amazon Echo、Apple HomePod）的远场语音识别核心依赖此技术。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输入要求</th>\n<th>SNR 改善</th>\n<th>失真</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谱减法</td>\n<td>单麦</td>\n<td>5-10 dB</td>\n<td>音乐噪声</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>嵌入式降噪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维纳滤波</td>\n<td>单麦</td>\n<td>8-12 dB</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>电话降噪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MVDR 波束</td>\n<td>多麦</td>\n<td>10-15 dB</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>智能音箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GSC 波束</td>\n<td>多麦</td>\n<td>12-18 dB</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>会议系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"深度学习降噪\">深度学习降噪</h2><p>深度学习方法将降噪建模为有监督回归问题——输入含噪特征，输出干净语音特征或掩码。</p>\n<p><strong>频域掩码估计</strong>是最主流的方法。模型预测每个时频点的掩码值（0-1），将掩码与含噪频谱相乘得到增强频谱。掩码类型包括理想比值掩码（IRM）、理想幅度掩码（IAM）和复数理想比值掩码（cIRM）。</p>\n<p><strong>DCCRN（Deep Complex CRN）</strong> 使用复数卷积直接处理复数频谱（同时建模幅度和相位），避免了传统方法中相位重建不准确的问题。在 DNS Challenge 2020 中取得优异成绩。</p>\n<p><strong>FullSubNet</strong> 结合全频带和子频带两个网络：全频带 LSTM 捕获全局频谱模式，子频带 LSTM 对每个频率组独立建模局部细节，两者的输出融合后预测最终掩码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torch import nn&#10;&#10;class ConvTasNet(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, n_sources: int = 2):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = nn.Conv1d(1, 256, kernel_size=20, stride=10)&#10;        self.separator = nn.LSTM(256, 512, num_layers=4, bidirectional=True)&#10;        self.mask_net = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(1024, 256 * n_sources),&#10;            nn.Sigmoid(),&#10;        )&#10;        self.decoder = nn.ConvTranspose1d(256, 1, kernel_size=20, stride=10)&#10;        self.n_sources = n_sources&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, mixture: torch.Tensor) -&gt; torch.Tensor:&#10;        encoded = self.encoder(mixture)&#10;        B, N, T = encoded.shape&#10;        lstm_out, _ = self.separator(encoded.permute(2, 0, 1))&#10;        masks = self.mask_net(lstm_out).permute(1, 2, 0)&#10;        masks = masks.view(B, self.n_sources, N, T)&#10;        separated = encoded.unsqueeze(1) * masks&#10;        return torch.stack([self.decoder(separated[:, i]) for i in range(self.n_sources)], dim=1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConvTasNet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_sources: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv1d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.separator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.LSTM(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bidirectional</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_sources),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Sigmoid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ConvTranspose1d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_sources </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_sources</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, mixture: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        encoded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(mixture)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        B, N, T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoded.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lstm_out, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.separator(encoded.permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_net(lstm_out).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        masks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> masks.view(B, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_sources, N, T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        separated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoded.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> masks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.stack([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder(separated[:, i]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_sources)], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph DNS Challenge 模型演进&#10;        CRN[CRN&lt;br&gt;卷积循环网络] --&gt; DCCRN[DCCRN&lt;br&gt;复数域CRN]&#10;        DCCRN --&gt; FSN[FullSubNet&lt;br&gt;全频带+子频带]&#10;        FSN --&gt; FSN2[FullSubNet+&lt;br&gt;Channel Attention]&#10;        FSN2 --&gt; DPTN[DPTNet&lt;br&gt;双路径Transformer]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph DNS Challenge 模型演进\n        CRN[CRN&lt;br&gt;卷积循环网络] --&gt; DCCRN[DCCRN&lt;br&gt;复数域CRN]\n        DCCRN --&gt; FSN[FullSubNet&lt;br&gt;全频带+子频带]\n        FSN --&gt; FSN2[FullSubNet+&lt;br&gt;Channel Attention]\n        FSN2 --&gt; DPTN[DPTNet&lt;br&gt;双路径Transformer]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>PESQ</th>\n<th>SI-SNR 改善</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>实时系数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRN</td>\n<td>Conv + LSTM</td>\n<td>2.95</td>\n<td>12.5 dB</td>\n<td>~3M</td>\n<td>20×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCCRN</td>\n<td>Complex Conv + LSTM</td>\n<td>3.27</td>\n<td>14.1 dB</td>\n<td>~4M</td>\n<td>15×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FullSubNet</td>\n<td>双 LSTM</td>\n<td>3.31</td>\n<td>15.8 dB</td>\n<td>~6M</td>\n<td>8×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPCRN</td>\n<td>DualPath + CRN</td>\n<td>3.33</td>\n<td>15.2 dB</td>\n<td>~1M</td>\n<td>30×</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"去混响与回声消除\">去混响与回声消除</h2><p>混响和回声是通信和录音场景中的重要退化因素。</p>\n<p><strong>加权预测误差（WPE）</strong> 是经典的去混响算法。它基于线性预测模型，利用当前帧之前的多帧信号预测并消除晚期混响成分。WPE 对早期反射保留较好，不会过度处理导致语音失真。</p>\n<p><strong>声学回声消除（AEC）</strong> 在全双工通话场景中尤为重要——麦克风会采集到扬声器播放的远端信号（回声），需要从近端信号中消除。自适应滤波器（NLMS、RLS）估计扬声器到麦克风的声学路径，生成回声估计并减去：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>退化类型</th>\n<th>典型算法</th>\n<th>延迟要求</th>\n<th>难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远场语音</td>\n<td>混响 RT60 &gt; 0.5s</td>\n<td>WPE + 波束</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>晚期混响分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频会议</td>\n<td>回声 + 噪声</td>\n<td>AEC + 降噪</td>\n<td>低 (&lt;20ms)</td>\n<td>双端通话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>车载语音</td>\n<td>风噪 + 引擎噪声</td>\n<td>多麦降噪</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>非平稳噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>录音室后期</td>\n<td>轻混响</td>\n<td>扩散场去混响</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>保持自然度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>RNNoise（Mozilla）</strong> 是一个极轻量的实时降噪库（模型仅约 85KB），使用 GRU 网络在频域预测 22 个子带的增益值。它被集成到 WebRTC、Discord、OBS 等多个实时通信软件中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音频格式与采样率处理\">音频格式与采样率处理</h2><p>工程实践中，音频格式转换和采样率处理是不可忽视的基础工作。</p>\n<p><strong>采样率选择</strong>直接影响系统性能和资源消耗：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样率</th>\n<th>频率范围</th>\n<th>带宽</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8 kHz</td>\n<td>0-4 kHz</td>\n<td>窄带</td>\n<td>电话语音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16 kHz</td>\n<td>0-8 kHz</td>\n<td>宽带</td>\n<td>ASR 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22.05 kHz</td>\n<td>0-11 kHz</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>TTS 合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>44.1 kHz</td>\n<td>0-22 kHz</td>\n<td>全带</td>\n<td>CD 音质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>48 kHz</td>\n<td>0-24 kHz</td>\n<td>全带</td>\n<td>专业音频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>重采样算法</strong>的质量差异很大。线性插值会引入混叠，应使用 sinc 插值（librosa.resample）或 polyphase 滤波器（torchaudio.transforms.Resample）。下采样前必须先低通滤波以防止混叠。</p>\n<p><strong>响度归一化</strong>确保不同来源的音频有一致的音量水平。ITU-R BS.1770 标准定义了响度度量单位 LUFS（Loudness Units Full Scale），音频流媒体平台通常归一化到 -14 到 -16 LUFS。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>音频预处理是所有语音 AI 系统的基础，处理加性噪声、混响、回声和信道失真四类退化</li>\n<li>传统方法（谱减法、维纳滤波、波束成形）计算量小，适合嵌入式和实时场景</li>\n<li>深度学习方法（DCCRN、FullSubNet）通过频域掩码估计实现 15dB+ 的 SNR 改善，但需要 GPU 推理</li>\n<li>RNNoise 以 85KB 模型大小实现了实用级实时降噪，被广泛集成到通信软件中</li>\n<li>工程实践中采样率选择（16kHz for ASR, 22kHz for TTS）和响度归一化（LUFS）不可忽视</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音频预处理与增强","id":"音频预处理与增强"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"传统信号处理方法","id":"传统信号处理方法"},{"level":2,"text":"深度学习降噪","id":"深度学习降噪"},{"level":2,"text":"去混响与回声消除","id":"去混响与回声消除"},{"level":2,"text":"音频格式与采样率处理","id":"音频格式与采样率处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"音乐信息检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/audio-understanding/music-information-retrieval"},"next":{"title":"实时音频处理流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/production-audio-systems/real-time-audio-pipeline"}}